SUMMARY:A Marshall House Project Jimi Hendrix Experience
DESCRIPTION:This Memorial Weekend\, the psychedelic gets properly unleashed. \nMarshall House Project — Santa Rosa’s own soul-funk powerhouse — brings the spirit of Hendrix to the Roadhouse for one special night. \nNot a cover band. Not cosplay. \nMHP channels the raw electricity\, improvisation\, distortion\, and fearless experimentation that made Hendrix untouchable. \n  \nTheir sound has been described as “the love child of Jimi Hendrix and The Meters after a long night drinking with space aliens.” And honestly… that’s pretty accurate. \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/a-marshall-house-project-jimi-hendrix-experience/
