SUMMARY:Sirsy at The Elephant in the Room
DESCRIPTION:t’s hard to imagine a sound this big coming from two people. The Boston Globe calls Sirsy “The little band with the big sound.” Fans call them “the little band with a big heart.” Whether playing a full-on electric show or a stripped-down acoustic one\, Sirsy’s show is genuine\, moving\, and fans say\, “life changing”. SIRSY plays heartfelt\, soulful\, singer-songwriter rock-pop with a charming intensity. Their songs are compelling\, instantly relatable\, and catchy as hell. The Times Union says “Sirsy’s clever\, smart songs have more hooks than a tackle box”. Sirsy’s live shows are known for their passionate performances that are equal parts rock energy and folk intimacy with just the right amount of pluck. Mel and Rich are also gifted storytellers … and lovable nerds. They can somehow make an audience sing along\, dance\, laugh\, and cry – all at the same show.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sirsy-at-the-elephant-in-the-room/
LOCATION:Elephant in the Room\, 177A Healdsburg Avenue\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
