SUMMARY:NOTORIOUS (Live in Concert) at the Vintage Space
DESCRIPTION:Experience Notorious\, the SF nightclub dance band turning Motown\, rock\, and today’s hits into a nonstop dance party. High energy all night! \nAbout Notorious \nNotorious is a powerhouse dance band with a devoted following and a reputation for lighting up every room. Consistently ranked among top wedding and event bands by Martha Stewart Weddings\, Modern Bride\, The Knot\, and others\, they are the choice for clients seeking packed dance floors and truly unforgettable nights everywhere that feel electric\, joyful\, and effortlessly celebratory experiences.\nFormed out of San Francisco’s legendary nightclub scene\, Notorious is a real band with no hired guns or rotating cast. The same top-tier musicians bring chemistry\, precision\, and energy to every show\, spanning Motown\, classic rock\, timeless favorites\, and today’s biggest hits\, delivered with style\, soul\, and undeniable party-starting authenticity that turns performances into celebrations audiences remember fondly afterward.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/notorious-live-in-concert-at-the-vintage-space/
LOCATION:Vintage Space at The Flamingo Resort\, 2777 Fourth St.\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
