SUMMARY:Sports Cards & Memorabilia Show
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a full day of sports cards\, collectibles\, trading\, and community at the Sports Cards Collectors of America Show! \nBrowse vendors featuring: \n• Sports memorabilia\n• Sports trading cards\n• Pokémon cards\n• One Piece cards\n• Magic: The Gathering cards\n• Comic books and collectibles\n• Toys\, retro items\, and other collector merchandise \nThe main show runs from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM\, followed by a special Trading Night from 5:00 PM to 9:00 PM where collectors can buy\, sell\, trade\, and connect with fellow hobby enthusiasts. \nShow Hours: 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM\nMain Vendor Show: 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\nTrading Night: 5:00 PM – 9:00 PM \nAdmission: $5 for visitors \nVendors Wanted!\nVendor tables are available for $100 per table. \nFor more information or to reserve a vendor table:\nCall: (707) 762-6125\nEmail: contact@sportscardscoa.com \nVisit the website at sportscardscoa.com
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sports-cards-memorabilia-show/
LOCATION:Herzog Hall\, 175 Fairgrounds Drive\, Petaluma\, 94952
CATEGORIES:Other
